---
// Four-panel comic strip for idea-mapping "01 Problem": the Roof Leak Reporting case
// (teacher reports → manager assigns → technician searches → record ends up in a CSV).
// Same visual language as ProblemScenes (Wiki): black hand-drawn strokes, one accent colour
// (var(--cs-accent)), slight wobble, no faces, no text in the art, 1–4 comic dots per panel.
// Illustrations are decorative (aria-hidden); the captions carry the meaning.
---
<figure class="ps">
  <svg width="0" height="0" class="ps-defs" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <defs>
      <filter id="mps-wobble" x="-5%" y="-5%" width="110%" height="110%">
        <feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.035" numOctaves="2" seed="7" />
        <feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" scale="2.2" />
      </filter>
    </defs>
  </svg>
  <ol class="ps-grid">
    <li class="ps-card">
      <svg class="ps-art" viewBox="0 0 184 138" aria-hidden="true">
 <g filter="url(#mps-wobble)" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
  <path d="M4 5 L180 4 L179 133 L5 132 Z"/>
  <path d="M5 26 L179 25"/>
  <path d="M78 26 Q102 40 126 26 Z" style="fill:var(--cs-accent);fill-opacity:.16" stroke="none"/>
  <path d="M96 25 L102 31 L108 25" stroke-width="1.6"/>
  <path d="M60 18 L66 12 M120 17 L126 11 M150 19 L156 13" stroke-width="1.4"/>
  <circle cx="42" cy="66" r="12" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M20 124 Q22 92 42 90 Q62 92 64 124" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M58 98 L74 88 L80 98 L64 108 Z" style="fill:var(--cs-accent);fill-opacity:.35" stroke-width="1.8"/>
  <path d="M120 100 L148 100 L144 124 L124 124 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M123 110 L145 110 L144 124 L124 124 Z" style="fill:var(--cs-accent);fill-opacity:.16" stroke="none"/>
  <path d="M118 100 Q134 94 150 100" stroke-width="1.6"/>
 </g>
 <g filter="url(#mps-wobble)" style="fill:var(--cs-accent)">
  <path d="M102 36 Q106 43 102 46 Q98 43 102 36 Z"/>
  <path d="M104 56 Q108 63 104 66 Q100 63 104 56 Z"/>
  <path d="M106 76 Q110 83 106 86 Q102 83 106 76 Z"/>
  <path d="M126 112 Q134 108 142 112 L141 116 Q134 113 127 116 Z"/>
 </g>
 <g fill="#111111"><circle cx="172" cy="124" r="2.8"/></g>
</svg>
      <h3 class="ps-title">A teacher spots a leak</h3>
      <p class="ps-text">On a rainy day, water drips into a classroom. She reports it from her phone: where, when, a photo.</p>
    </li>

    <li class="ps-card">
      <svg class="ps-art" viewBox="0 0 184 138" aria-hidden="true">
 <g filter="url(#mps-wobble)" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
  <path d="M4 5 L180 4 L179 133 L5 132 Z"/>
  <path d="M22 22 L98 21 L99 116 L23 117 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M32 34 L70 33" />
  <path d="M32 48 L88 47 M32 58 L80 57" stroke-width="1.4"/>
  <path d="M32 72 L88 71 L88 98 L32 99 Z" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill:var(--cs-accent);fill-opacity:.16"/>
  <path d="M36 94 L48 82 L58 90 L66 84 L84 96" stroke-width="1.4"/>
  
  <circle cx="154" cy="56" r="11" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M136 112 Q138 84 154 82 Q170 84 172 112" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
 </g>
 <g filter="url(#mps-wobble)" style="stroke:var(--cs-accent)" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
  <path d="M106 66 L132 65"/><path d="M126 59 L133 65 L126 71"/>
 </g>
 <g filter="url(#mps-wobble)">
  <path d="M74 32 L90 32 L90 40 L74 40 Z" style="fill:var(--cs-accent)" />
 </g>
 <g fill="#111111"><circle cx="163" cy="124" r="2.8"/><circle cx="172" cy="124" r="2.8"/></g>
</svg>
      <h3 class="ps-title">It gets assigned</h3>
      <p class="ps-text">The manager sets the severity and picks a technician. The location travels as a line of text.</p>
    </li>

    <li class="ps-card">
      <svg class="ps-art" viewBox="0 0 184 138" aria-hidden="true">
 <g filter="url(#mps-wobble)" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
  <path d="M4 5 L180 4 L179 133 L5 132 Z"/>
  <path d="M20 30 L110 29 L111 120 L21 121 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M21 60 L110 59 M21 90 L110 89"/>
  <path d="M22 61 L109 60 L109 88 L22 89 Z" style="fill:var(--cs-accent);fill-opacity:.16" stroke="none"/>
  <path d="M30 120 L30 112 L40 112 L40 104 L50 104 L50 96 L60 96 L60 90" stroke-width="1.6"/>
  <path d="M70 46 L82 45 L82 56 L70 57 Z M90 46 L102 45 L102 56 L90 57 Z M70 106 L82 105 L82 116 L70 117 Z" stroke-width="1.4"/>
  <circle cx="72" cy="70" r="7" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M62 89 Q63 78 72 77 Q81 78 82 89" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  
  <path d="M146 30 L172 29 L172 102 L146 103 Z" style="fill:var(--cs-accent);fill-opacity:.16" stroke-width="1.6"/>
  <path d="M146 60 L172 59 M146 90 L172 89" stroke-width="1.4"/>
 </g>
 <g filter="url(#mps-wobble)" style="stroke:var(--cs-accent)" fill="none" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round">
  <path d="M86 64 Q86 58 92 58 Q98 58 98 63 Q98 67 92 69 L92 72"/>
  <path d="M92 77 L92 77.5"/>
  <path d="M120 72 L140 71 M132 64 L140 71 L132 78" stroke-width="1.8"/>
  <path d="M152 40 Q156 47 152 50 Q148 47 152 40 Z" style="fill:var(--cs-accent)" stroke="none"/>
 </g>
 <g fill="#111111"><circle cx="167.5" cy="115.5" r="2.8"/><circle cx="163" cy="124" r="2.8"/><circle cx="172" cy="124" r="2.8"/></g>
</svg>
      <h3 class="ps-title">The tech goes looking</h3>
      <p class="ps-text">Building, floor and room are words on a screen. On a big campus, finding the right ceiling takes a walk.</p>
    </li>

    <li class="ps-card">
      <svg class="ps-art" viewBox="0 0 184 138" aria-hidden="true">
 <g filter="url(#mps-wobble)" fill="none" stroke="#111111" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
  <path d="M4 5 L180 4 L179 133 L5 132 Z"/>
  <path d="M18 24 L84 23 L85 112 L19 113 Z" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
  <path d="M20 38 L83 37 L83 51 L20 52 Z M20 66 L83 65 L83 79 L20 80 Z" style="fill:var(--cs-accent);fill-opacity:.16" stroke="none"/>
  <path d="M19 38 L84 37 M19 52 L84 51 M19 66 L84 65 M19 80 L84 79 M19 94 L84 93" stroke-width="1.3"/>
  <path d="M40 24 L41 112 M62 23 L63 112" stroke-width="1.3"/>
  <path d="M100 34 L124 26 L148 34 L170 26 L170 104 L148 112 L124 104 L100 112 Z" style="fill:var(--cs-accent);fill-opacity:.16"/>
  <path d="M124 26 L124 104 M148 34 L148 112" stroke-width="1.4"/>
 </g>
 <g filter="url(#mps-wobble)" style="stroke:var(--cs-accent)" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
  <path d="M24 44 L36 44 M24 72 L36 72 M24 86 L36 86" stroke-width="2.4"/>
  <path d="M135 58 Q135 46 145 46 Q155 46 155 58 Q155 66 145 78 Q135 66 135 58 Z" stroke-dasharray="3 3"/>
 </g>
 <g fill="#111111"><circle cx="163" cy="115.5" r="2.8"/><circle cx="172" cy="115.5" r="2.8"/><circle cx="163" cy="124" r="2.8"/><circle cx="172" cy="124" r="2.8"/></g>
</svg>
      <h3 class="ps-title">It ends up in a CSV</h3>
      <p class="ps-text">The fix is logged and exported for the principal. Where leaks keep happening never shows up on a map.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</figure>

<style>
  .ps { margin: 0; }
  .ps-defs { position: absolute; width: 0; height: 0; overflow: hidden; }
  .ps-grid { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  .ps-card { display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr; gap: 6px; }
  .ps-art { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; margin-bottom: 10px; background: transparent; overflow: visible; }
  .ps-title { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; color: #111111; }
  .ps-text { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #3A3A3A; }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .ps-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 28px 20px; } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .ps-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .ps-art { max-width: 360px; } }
</style>
